2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
400 Bullets is a action, war, mystery film directed by Tom Paton.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
One cold winter night in Afghanistan is about to get a whole lot worse for Rana Rae, a Gurkha soldier left to guard a British military
outpost, when Captain Noah Brandt arrives looking for refuge from a group of rogue special ops and a cell of heavily armed Taliban.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
The two soldiers must fight for their lives as they attempt to call for backup before the rogue squad, led by the
backstabbing Sergeant Bartlett, can hunt them down to retrieve a case of missile guidance chips that Noah intercepted.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
But Bartlett and his men do not count on Rana, whose ferocious
Gurkha training makes him a force to be reckoned with.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Rana Rae, played by Jean-Paul Ly.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Noah Brandt, played by Andrew-Lee Potts.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
